inition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"當著對方的面揭穿謊言或指出問題。","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[0].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"她說話總是（　），輕聲細語，讓人感到如沐春風。","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[1].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"雙方爭執不下，里長出面（　），終於化解衝突。","n":22,"ssz":"....1...1............."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[2].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"她每天（　）於各科教室之間，忙碌得像個小蜜蜂。","n":23,"ssz":"................1.1...."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[3].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他（　）了對方的藉口，場面一度尷尬。","n":18,"ssz":".............1...."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[4].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"區間車準時到站，接著轉乘高鐵，兩段行程（　），時間充裕。","n":28,"ssz":"............................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[5].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"領導者應有（　），接納不同的看法，才能服眾。","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[6].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他（　），交際手腕高明，一下子就能和各方談成合作。","n":25,"ssz":"............1.1..1......."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[7].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他喜歡把大家（　）的事直接說出來，常常弄得現場很尷尬。","n":27,"ssz":"....................1......"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請問哪一個句子使用語詞正確？","n":14,"ssz":"...11.1......."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"她「長袖善舞」穿梭舞台之中，優美的舞姿令人心動不已","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"當謊言被「戳破」的那一刻，他的臉瞬間漲得通紅","n":22,"ssz":"..........1........1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"氣溫突然升高，我們把冷氣的「調度」到二十六度才舒服","n":25,"ssz":"..............1.........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"新買的手機操作簡單，拍照也很清晰，功能「銜接無虞」","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].questio